    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s m\u00e6ssepreostes ond sancti SE24B3 \u00d0a comon of eastd\u00e6le in Galwala m\u00e6g\u00f0e ond \u00fe\u00e6r monige men \u00feur fulwiht gel\u00e6rdon to SE24B8 \u00c6ryst se casere him bead gold ond seolfor wi\u00f0 \u00f0on \u00f0e hy forleton Cristes geleafan. SE24B10 \u00d0a noldon hy \u00f0\u00e6t. SE24B10 \u00d0a het he mid stengum heora sweoran forslean. SE24B13 \u00d0a leordon \u00fea gastas to ecum gefean, ond \u00e6t heora lichoman w\u00e6ron monug wundru SE25A1 On \u00f0one XXV d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s halgan weres gemind se w\u00e6s on \u00f0isse Brytene, SE25A3 He w\u00e6s sumes haliges mynstres abbod be nor\u00f0an gem\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s gehalgod sancte Petre. SE25A5 Ond \u00f0a on his yldo ongan he feran to Rome, ond \u00ferim dagum \u00e6r\u00f0on \u00fee he ferde he s\u00e6gde SE25A8 Ond si\u00f0\u00f0an he on si\u00f0e w\u00e6s, he asong \u00e6lce d\u00e6ge tuwa his saltere ond his m\u00e6ssan, butan SE25A11 He w\u00e6s on LXXIIII geara \u00fea he for\u00f0ferde. SE25A12 \u00c6fter hundteontegum daga ond XIIII \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e he of his mynstre ferde, he geleorde on SE25A18 \u00de\u00e6r his geferscipe hyne tod\u00e6lde on \u00fereo. SE25A19 An d\u00e6l ferde for\u00f0 to Rome, o\u00f0er d\u00e6l cyrde eft to Brytene ond \u00fe\u00e6t s\u00e6gdon, ond se \u00feridda SE26A1 On \u00f0one XXVI d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancta Justinan tid \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mnan ond \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes SE26",
